      "content": "hey im working on a policy draft for a museum about how we handle stuff we got during the colonial period... like the artifacts that people are asking to have sent back home. can u help me write a short intro for the policy that explains the different sides of the debate? basically want to acknowledge why some people want them returned and why some think they should stay in big museums like ours.",
